Package: openkal-client
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, zenity, fonts-dejavu-core
Description: open-source KalOnline client
 OpenKal is an open-source client for KalOnline-compatible game data.
 The package contains no proprietary game assets. Configure the paths to a
 locally available KalOnline client directory on its first start.
